{"seq":1,"slug":"purchase-flow-state-machine","title":"客户端购买流程与状态机（StoreKit 2 async 与 Play Billing 流程）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-in-app-purchase-subscription-revenuecat-engineering/purchase-flow-receipt-validation/purchase-flow-state-machine","wordCount":2270,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"客户端购买流程与状态机-storekit-2-async-与-play-billing-流程\">客户端购买流程与状态机（StoreKit 2 async 与 Play Billing 流程）</h1><p>购买按钮被按下之后，客户端并不&quot;完成&quot;一次购买——它只是把一次意图提交给商店，然后进入一个由<strong>商店、客户端、服务端三方各自持有状态</strong>的对账流程。跨境电商应用最容易踩的坑，是把&quot;用户点了购买&quot;等同于&quot;已收款&quot;，于是在网络抖动、未决支付、跨设备恢复这些路径上重复发放或错误发放权益。本文从两个平台 2026 年的真实 API 出发，把购买拆成一个可枚举的状态机，并给出每条边的处理规则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三方各自持有的交易状态\">核心概念：三方各自持有的交易状态</h2><p>要理解购买流程，先接受一个反直觉的事实：<strong>同一笔交易在三个地方有各自的副本，且会短暂不一致</strong>。客户端内存里有一条 <code>Product.PurchaseResult</code> 或 <code>Purchase</code> 对象；商店（App Store / Google Play）持有权威交易账本；服务端保存应用自己发放的权益记录。商店是真相源，客户端是观测点，服务端才是授权点。状态机的每个状态，本质上都在描述&quot;这三份副本是否一致、谁需要再同步&quot;。跨境售后工单里&quot;我付了钱但没有会员&quot;，绝大多数就是这三份副本没在正确时间点收敛。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么购买流程天然是一个状态机\">为什么购买流程天然是一个状态机</h2><p>商店的购买结果不是二元的。Apple 的 <code>Product.PurchaseResult</code> 与 Google 的 <code>Purchase.purchaseState</code> 都给出了&quot;既非成功也非失败&quot;的中间态：用户可能正在等待家人批准（Ask to Buy），也可能在便利店用现金付款、几天后才到账（pending）。这类交易在本地只是一条挂起记录，真正生效的信号要等商店后续送达。</p>\n<p>因此购买流程的正确模型是：<strong>客户端发起 → 商店裁决 → 客户端与服务端各自依据商店的可信凭据更新本地状态</strong>。因此在任何一步都可能延迟、跨设备发生、或只在应用重启后才被观察到——这正是两平台强制&quot;启动时对账&quot;而非&quot;只在购买回调处理&quot;的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"storekit-2-async-await-购买调用的三种结果\">StoreKit 2：async/await 购买调用的三种结果</h2><p>StoreKit 2 把购买建模为一个 <code>async throws</code> 调用，返回一个有限的枚举：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"func purchase(options: Set&lt;Product.PurchaseOption&gt; = []) async throws -&gt; Product.PurchaseResult\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>func purchase(options: Set&#x3C;Product.PurchaseOption> = []) async throws -> Product.PurchaseResult</span></span></code></pre></div><p>来源：<a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/storekit/product/purchase(options:)\">Apple Developer — Product.purchase(options:)</a></p>\n<p><code>PurchaseResult</code> 的三种 case 恰好对应状态机的三个分支：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>结果</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>客户端动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>.success(VerificationResult&lt;Transaction&gt;)</code></td>\n<td>商店返回了一笔已签名交易</td>\n<td><strong>先验签，仅在 <code>.verified</code> 时发放权益</strong>，然后 <code>finish()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>.userCancelled</code></td>\n<td>用户主动取消</td>\n<td>无状态变更，静默返回</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>.pending</code></td>\n<td>等待外部批准（如 Ask to Buy）</td>\n<td><strong>不发放权益</strong>，等待 <code>Transaction.updates</code> 后续送达</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键约束是 <code>VerificationResult</code> 这个泛型枚举：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"enum VerificationResult&lt;SignedType&gt; {&#10;    case verified(SignedType)&#10;    case unverified(SignedType, VerificationError)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">enum</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> VerificationResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SignedType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> verified</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(SignedType)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unverified</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(SignedType, VerificationError)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>即使拿到 <code>.success</code>，也必须先做 JWS 验签：<code>.unverified</code> 分支携带的 <code>Transaction</code> <strong>不得</strong>用于解锁内容，更不能 <code>finish()</code>。<code>.success</code> 里的交易只有在 <code>transaction.revocationDate == nil</code> 且未过期时才代表真实权益。</p>\n<p>购买意图本身的附加信息通过 <code>Set&lt;Product.PurchaseOption&gt;</code> 传入，跨境电商常用的是 <code>.appAccountToken(UUID)</code>——把一个应用内账号 ID 绑进交易，让服务端能把交易归属到具体用户：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"let result = try await product.purchase(options: [&#10;    .appAccountToken(accountUUID),&#10;])\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> try</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> product.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">purchase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">options</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">appAccountToken</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(accountUUID),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"play-billing-回调式的-launchbillingflow\">Play Billing：回调式的 launchBillingFlow</h2><p>Android 侧没有 async/await 语义，购买流程由三步同步/异步混合调用组成：<code>queryProductDetailsAsync()</code> 查商品 → <code>launchBillingFlow(activity, params)</code> 发起 → 结果通过 <code>PurchasesUpdatedListener.onPurchasesUpdated()</code> 回调送达。来源：<a href=\"https://developer.android.com/google/play/billing/integrate\">Android Developers — Integrate the Google Play Billing Library</a>。</p>\n<p>一个必须先做的配置是启用未决交易，否则 <code>PENDING</code> 流程会被直接拒绝：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"val billingClient = BillingClient.newBuilder(context)&#10;    .setListener(listener)&#10;    .enablePendingPurchases(&#10;        PendingPurchasesParams.newBuilder().enableOneTimeProducts().build()&#10;    )&#10;    .enableAutoServiceReconnection()&#10;    .build()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val billingClient = BillingClient.newBuilder(context)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .setListener(listener)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .enablePendingPurchases(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        PendingPurchasesParams.newBuilder().enableOneTimeProducts().build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .enableAutoServiceReconnection()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .build()</span></span></code></pre></div><p>回调里的裁决依据是 <code>Purchase.purchaseState</code>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>PurchaseState.PURCHASED</code>：状态已生效，可走&quot;服务端校验 → 发放权益 → acknowledge/consume&quot;。</li>\n<li><code>PurchaseState.PENDING</code>：<strong>不得发放权益，也不得 acknowledge</strong>。等到付款完成后，监听器会再收到一次 <code>PURCHASED</code> 更新。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>版本约束在 2026 年强制生效：新应用与更新须在 <strong>2026-08-31</strong> 前使用 <strong>Billing Library 8+</strong>，缓冲期至 <strong>2026-11-01</strong>；9 为当前主版本，8/9 分别支持到 2027-08-31 与 2028-08-31（来源：<a href=\"https://developer.android.com/google/play/billing/deprecation-faq\">Deprecation FAQ</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"交易状态机-从发起走到两份确认\">交易状态机：从发起走到两份确认</h2><p>把两个平台的语义统一后，一笔交易的生命周期可以画成同一张图。注意右侧的分叉：只有 <code>PURCHASED</code> 才进入确认窗口，而确认窗口本身有超时退款风险。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[发起购买&lt;br/&gt;purchase / launchBillingFlow] --&gt; B{商店裁决}&#10;    B --&gt;|userCancelled / USER_CANCELED| C[终止&lt;br/&gt;无权益变更]&#10;    B --&gt;|pending / PENDING| D[挂起&lt;br/&gt;等待外部批准或线下付款]&#10;    D --&gt;|后续更新| E[收到 PURCHASED]&#10;    B --&gt;|success 且 verified| F[已购买&lt;br/&gt;PURCHASED]&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[服务端用收据/购买令牌校验]&#10;    G --&gt;|校验通过| H[发放权益并持久化]&#10;    G --&gt;|校验失败| I[留存人工核查&lt;br/&gt;不发放]&#10;    H --&gt; J[客户端确认&lt;br/&gt;finish / acknowledge / consume]&#10;    J --&gt;|超时未确认| K[商店自动退款并撤销权益]\">flowchart TD\n    A[发起购买&lt;br/&gt;purchase / launchBillingFlow] --&gt; B{商店裁决}\n    B --&gt;|userCancelled / USER_CANCELED| C[终止&lt;br/&gt;无权益变更]\n    B --&gt;|pending / PENDING| D[挂起&lt;br/&gt;等待外部批准或线下付款]\n    D --&gt;|后续更新| E[收到 PURCHASED]\n    B --&gt;|success 且 verified| F[已购买&lt;br/&gt;PURCHASED]\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[服务端用收据/购买令牌校验]\n    G --&gt;|校验通过| H[发放权益并持久化]\n    G --&gt;|校验失败| I[留存人工核查&lt;br/&gt;不发放]\n    H --&gt; J[客户端确认&lt;br/&gt;finish / acknowledge / consume]\n    J --&gt;|超时未确认| K[商店自动退款并撤销权益]</pre><p>图中有两条边最易漏掉。第一条是 <code>D → E</code>：挂起交易可能在应用被杀后、或在另一台设备上完成，客户端必须靠启动时对账才发现。第二条是 <code>J → K</code>：Google Play 的确认窗口是<strong>三天</strong>，超时未 acknowledge 或 consume，商店会自动退款并撤销权益（见前述 Integrate 文档）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对账-启动时同步而非只依赖回调\">对账：启动时同步而非只依赖回调</h2><p>两个平台都要求&quot;全生命周期&quot;的观察者，而不是&quot;购买时&quot;的观察者。Apple 的 <code>Transaction.updates</code> 是一个长驻的异步序列，负责送达续订、撤销、家庭共享变更、促销兑换、Ask to Buy 批准等<strong>发生在购买调用之外</strong>的交易；<code>Transaction.currentEntitlements</code> 则在启动时给出当前有效权益快照。来源：<a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/storekit/transaction/updates\">Apple Developer — Transaction.updates</a>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"init() {&#10;    Task { await reconcileCurrentEntitlements() }   // 启动时同步&#10;    Task { await observeTransactionUpdates() }      // 全生命周期监听&#10;}&#10;&#10;func observeTransactionUpdates() async {&#10;    for await result in Transaction.updates {&#10;        guard let transaction = try? verified(result) else { continue }&#10;        await reconcile(transaction)&#10;        try? await persistEntitlements()   // 先持久化&#10;        await transaction.finish()          // 再确认&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    Task</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> reconcileCurrentEntitlements</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() }   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 启动时同步</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    Task</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> observeTransactionUpdates</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() }      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 全生命周期监听</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> observeTransactionUpdates</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Transaction.updates {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        guard</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transaction </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> try?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> verified</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">continue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> reconcile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(transaction)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        try?</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> persistEntitlements</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 先持久化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transaction.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">finish</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 再确认</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Android 侧的对应动作是：连接成功后与每次 <code>onResume()</code> 调用 <code>queryPurchasesAsync()</code>，因为交易可能在应用不在前台时完成、在另一台设备上发生、或由促销产生。这是 <code>D → E</code> 那条边在工程上唯一可靠的捕获点。</p>\n<p>顺序上有一条不可交换的纪律：<strong>先持久化权益，再 <code>finish()</code></strong>。如果反过来，应用在 <code>finish()</code> 之后、写盘之前崩溃，StoreKit 认为交易已处理，不会重投，权益就永久丢失了。反之若先写盘后 <code>finish()</code> 时崩溃，交易会被重投，此时靠幂等（用 <code>transactionID</code> 去重）收敛即可。</p>\n<h2 id=\"幂等键与重复发放的防线\">幂等键与重复发放的防线</h2><p>重投是设计的一部分，不是异常，所以发放逻辑必须幂等。可用的天然幂等键：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>幂等键</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>StoreKit 2</td>\n<td><code>Transaction.id</code>（及 <code>originalID</code>）</td>\n<td>同一笔交易重投时 id 不变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Play Billing</td>\n<td><code>Purchase.purchaseToken</code></td>\n<td>同一笔购买的唯一令牌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>StoreKit 2（订阅）</td>\n<td><code>Transaction.originalID</code></td>\n<td>跨续订周期保持同一原始订阅</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>服务端应把幂等键作为唯一索引写入权益表：插入冲突即代表重复投递，直接返回既有权益而不重复发放。这在跨设备对账与未决转正（挂起变 <code>PURCHASED</code> 时监听器与启动对账可能同时命中同一笔）下都会真实发生。确认窗口本身也携带时间约束，值得显式建模：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>U</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>72</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>h</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{ack} = t_{PURCHASED} + 72\\,\\text{h}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">72</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">h</span></span></span></span></span></span>，超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{ack}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 仍未确认，Google Play 会自动退款并撤销权益。因此确认动作应纳入重试队列，而非&quot;回调里做一次、失败就算了&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨境电商场景下的额外考量\">跨境电商场景下的额外考量</h2><p>跨境的购买流程比单市场多了三层：<strong>币种与地区定价</strong>由商店按用户账号所在区域决定，客户端必须渲染 <code>Product.displayPrice</code> / <code>ProductDetails</code> 返回的本地化字符串，不可硬编码；<strong>税务合规</strong>（如欧盟 IOSS、美国各州销售税）由商店代收代缴，收据里只记录成交金额与币种，不应自行计税；<strong>沙盒测试</strong>方面，Apple 用 Sandbox 账号与 <code>simulatesAskToBuyInSandbox</code> 模拟 Ask to Buy，Google 用 License Testers 与测试卡模拟，两者都必须覆盖 <code>pending → PURCHASED</code> 路径。</p>\n<p>一个常被忽略的执法现实：所有&quot;购买 → 发放&quot;的判断必须以商店的<strong>已签名凭据</strong>为唯一真相源。本地标志位、<code>UserDefaults</code> 布尔值、甚至客户端自行解析的收据都不可信——它们只用于 UI，服务端校验结果才是授权依据。收据校验本身在下一篇同章节文档展开：参见 <a href=\"./\">购买流程、凭证与服务端收据校验工程</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>购买流程的本质是一致性协议，不是一次函数调用。两个平台在 2026 年给出的 API 形态不同（StoreKit 2 的 async 枚举 vs Play Billing 的回调 + state 字段），但状态机的骨架完全一致：发起 → 商店裁决（含挂起）→ 收到已签名凭据 → 服务端校验 → 发放并持久化 → 确认。真正决定线上质量的，是那些&quot;非成功、非失败&quot;的边——挂起转正、跨设备对账、重复投递、确认超时退款——能不能被显式建模并覆盖测试。把这些边处理对了，&quot;付了钱没权益&quot;和&quot;重复发放&quot;这两类最贵的缺陷就会同时消失。</p>\n<h2 id=\"落地检查清单\">落地检查清单</h2><ul>\n<li>启动即注册全生命周期监听（<code>Transaction.updates</code> / <code>onResume()</code> + <code>queryPurchasesAsync()</code>），不只在购买按钮处监听。</li>\n<li>只在 <code>.verified</code> / <code>PURCHASED</code> 分支发放权益；<code>pending</code>/<code>PENDING</code> 一律不发放、不确认。</li>\n<li>顺序固定为&quot;持久化 → <code>finish()</code>/<code>acknowledge()</code>&quot;，并以 <code>Transaction.id</code> / <code>purchaseToken</code> 幂等去重。</li>\n<li><code>acknowledge()</code> 放进可重试队列，盯住 72 小时确认窗口。</li>\n<li>价格与币种取自商店返回的本地化商品对象。</li>\n<li>测试矩阵覆盖：取消、挂起转正、跨设备对账、重复投递、确认超时。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Hub 内的相邻主题可继续阅读：<a href=\"../iap-platform-storekit-billing-model/\">应用内购平台与计费模型</a> 讲清两平台的产品与计费模型，<a href=\"../subscription-lifecycle-entitlement/\">订阅生命周期与权益管理</a> 承接续订、宽限期与权益回收，<a href=\"../revenue-integrity-price-ops-governance/\">收入完整性与价格运营治理</a> 处理退款、欺诈与对账差异。</p>\n<h2 id=\"参考来源\">参考来源</h2><ul>\n<li>Apple Developer，<code>Product.purchase(options:)</code> 与 <code>Transaction.updates</code>：<a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/storekit/product/purchase(options:)\">https://developer.apple.com/documentation/storekit/product/purchase(options:)</a></li>\n<li>Android Developers，Integrate the Play Billing Library 与 deprecation FAQ：<a href=\"https://developer.android.com/google/play/billing/integrate\">https://developer.android.com/google/play/billing/integrate</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"客户端购买流程与状态机（StoreKit 2 async 与 Play Billing 流程）","id":"客户端购买流程与状态机-storekit-2-async-与-play-billing-流程"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三方各自持有的交易状态","id":"核心概念-三方各自持有的交易状态"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么购买流程天然是一个状态机","id":"为什么购买流程天然是一个状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"StoreKit 2：async/await 购买调用的三种结果","id":"storekit-2-async-await-购买调用的三种结果"},{"level":2,"text":"Play Billing：回调式的 launchBillingFlow","id":"play-billing-回调式的-launchbillingflow"},{"level":2,"text":"交易状态机：从发起走到两份确认","id":"交易状态机-从发起走到两份确认"},{"level":2,"text":"对账：启动时同步而非只依赖回调","id":"对账-启动时同步而非只依赖回调"},{"level":2,"text":"幂等键与重复发放的防线","id":"幂等键与重复发放的防线"},{"level":2,"text":"跨境电商场景下的额外考量","id":"跨境电商场景下的额外考量"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"落地检查清单","id":"落地检查清单"},{"level":2,"text":"参考来源","id":"参考来源"}],"prev":{"title":"iOS 与 Android 计费能力差异与跨平台兼容矩阵","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-in-app-purchase-subscription-revenuecat-engineering/iap-platform-storekit-billing-model/iap-platform-difference-compat-matrix"},"next":{"title":"服务端收据校验：App Store Server API/JWS 与 Google Play Developer API","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-in-app-purchase-subscription-revenuecat-engineering/purchase-flow-receipt-validation/server-receipt-validation-jws"}}